            "review_title": "Review at Boat Noodle Bangkok - Saigon Centre",
            "review_text": "Sue R\n2 contributions\n0\nExtremely disappointing and dissatisfying experience with rude staff. Do yourself a favour and give it a wide berth.\nMar 2026 • Couples\nExtremely disappointing and dissatisfying experience. Some of the staff thought it was a good joke to tell us that what we wanted from the menu wasn’t available but 5 minutes later took an order and provided it to the table next to us. We were also told they only had enough “ left” to make 1 slushy but not 2, really….. not at all believable since slushies are basically ice and then got made for other customers after us. Also Apparently Pandan is coconut? Yeah sure….., I know my green pandan and it is not white coconut. They tried to argue that too, as if I am stupid. We have always been friendly and polite to all staff everywhere, but this lot thought giggling and laughing and taking us for a ride was OK. Not so… don’t bother going there if you are a tourist AND I hope the management see this and give the staff a rocket.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 29, 2026",
